cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RepoBalance in your research, teaching materials or internal tooling, please cite it as below."
title: "RepoBalance (仓衡)"
abstract: >-
  A cross-platform desktop application that runs a structured health checkup on
  local Git repositories: large files, zombie branches, commit habits, dependency
  health and leaked secrets, producing an exportable report. Fully local — no
  network requests, no telemetry, with secret evidence masked inside the Rust core.
type: software
